Description: Downloads and reads global datasets related to climate risk,
    susceptibility and vulnerability directly into R, without manual
    downloading. Includes the GLO-30 HAND (Height Above the Nearest Drainage)
    raster for flood susceptibility, and the geological risk cartography
    published by the Geological Survey of Brazil (SGB/CPRM) through its GeoSGB
    and RIGeo services.
